<title>UK: SQUASH-SUPER SERIES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-SUPER SERIES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HATFIELD, England 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Super Series squash finals on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Harrow group</p>
<p>Simon Parke (England) beat Chris Walker (England) 6-9 10-8 9-7 10-8</p>
<p>Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat Brett Martin (Australia) 6-9 9-4 7-9 10-8 9-3</p>
<p>Fleet group</p>
<p>Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat Peter Nicol (Scotland) 9-5 9-3 4-9 9-7</p>
<p>Jansher Khan (Pakistan) beat Zubair Jahan Khan (Pakistan) 9-5 9-7 9-4</p>
</text>
